# The monorepo root ignores *.pdf and *.png globally to keep experiment
# artefacts out of git. This report's compiled PDF and its vector figures are
# part of the deliverable, so re-include them here. The PNGs next to the
# figures are throwaway previews for eyeballing in an image viewer.
!*.pdf
figures/*.png

# LaTeX build intermediates
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
